        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/71e660/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-07T03:30:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In my mind, this was like Glamour's last-ditch attempt at redemption. So she actually was describing herself for the majority of the time, genuinely hoping Tachyon knew who she was. As soon as she admitted she didn't, Glamour went through with her plan.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It doesn't fit at all with Aislin murdering the previous Glamour, since by that point she's clearly pretty far gone, but I thought it could be interesting anyway.&nbsp;</p>",
